---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Documentation
description: Everything you need to build, run, and drive Arin.
permalink: /docs/
---

<div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-16 pt-36">
  <div class="max-w-2xl">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-frost sm:text-5xl">Documentation</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-mist">
      Everything you need to install Arin, run the daemon, drive it from an agent or a
      shell, and work on it.
    </p>
  </div>

  {% for section in docsSections %}
  <section class="mt-14 first:mt-12">
    <h2 class="font-display text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-mist">{{ section.name }}</h2>
    <div class="mt-5 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {% for doc in section.docs %}
      <a href="/docs/{{ doc.slug }}/" class="glass glass-edge group rounded-2xl p-6 transition hover:border-white/20">
        <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-frost transition group-hover:text-primary-soft">{{ doc.title }}</h3>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist">{{ doc.description }}</p>
        <span class="mt-4 inline-block text-sm font-medium text-primary-soft">Read &rarr;</span>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
